r":"tvdb_show","id":"278332","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"38192","synopsis":"The newly formed student council decides to start joining after school activities...all except Hades. With his love of the stars, Yui suggests he join the Astronomy Club, but he coldly refuses. Yui is determined to find out why.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AjBNAAoY1L3klbvhgtZCfYu4S9F.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"The newly formed student council decides to start joining after school activities...all except Hades. With his love of the stars, Yui suggests he join the Astronomy Club, but he coldly refuses. Yui is determined to find out why.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AjBNAAoY1L3klbvhgtZCfYu4S9F.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10305","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20542","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21563","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60828","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278332","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"38199","synopsis":"Takeru, otherwise known as the god Susanoo, is the last hold out yet to engage in any extracurricular activities. With their graduation hanging in the balance, Yui must duel with Takeru to see whether or not he will join a club.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4En1lOhTS797xw9wMxZOXHw0XNZ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Takeru, otherwise known as the god Susanoo, is the last hold out yet to engage in any extracurricular activities. With their graduation hanging in the balance, Yui must duel with Takeru to see whether or not he will join a club.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4En1lOhTS797xw9wMxZOXHw0XNZ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10305","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20542","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21563","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60828","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278332","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"38197","synopsis":"Tsukito agrees to prepare a moon viewing for Yui and the rest of the gods. However, overworking himself might undo all of his efforts.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/278332/4880423.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Tsukito agrees to prepare a moon viewing for Yui and the rest of the gods. However, overworking himself might undo all of his efforts.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"I sentimenti della luna piena","synopsis":"Tsukito has been chosen as a disciplinary member, but because of his eagerness to fulfil his responsibilities, he loses sleep and faints. Thoth threatens him that if he does something like this again he will be suspended, making Tsukito extremely depressed and determined to find out the reason for his mistakes. In response, Loki mischievously gives Tsukito and Yui a pair of lovers' rings that glue their hands together, and is unremovable until they gain a deep understanding of each other's hearts. Both of them connect over preparing for a Moon-Viewing Festival, to which Tsukito reveals how he only fulfils his duties and never enjoys anything, much to Yui's horror. The rings finally break off when Tsukito admits that he found preparing things with her fun.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10305","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20542","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21563","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60828","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278332","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"38191","synopsis":"The seasons suddenly turn, and the students decide to hold a Christmas event. Balder becomes upset after finding out he has to work apart from Yui.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/278332/4885897.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"The seasons suddenly turn, and the students decide to hold a Christmas event. Balder becomes upset after finding out he has to work apart from Yui.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Promessa delle lande congelate","synopsis":"Balder grows more attached to Yui because of her uniqueness in not being affected by his natural charisma as the Norse God of Light. As the season changes once again to winter, Yui and the gods decide to create a cultural festival based off Christmas, splitting into groups based on their heritage. Since Yui is Japanese, she has to work with the Japanese gods, much to Balder's jealousy. He drags her around with him everywhere, until Loki is absolutely frustrated, confronting his friend about a promise they made as children to always stay together no matter what, believing that Yui is coming between their friendship.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10305","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20542","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21563","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60828","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278332","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"38195","synopsis":"Tensions flare at the Christmas market, where Loki and Balder face off in front of Yui.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8UDClqEHaNs6E4hGnXsVfu9vSqc.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Tensions flare at the Christmas market, where Loki and Balder face off in front of Yui.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8UDClqEHaNs6E4hGnXsVfu9vSqc.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10305","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20542","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21563","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60828","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278332","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"38198","synopsis":"The academy has been open for six month now and with exams around the corner, Yui must prepare.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/278332/4896451.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"The academy has been open for six month now and with exams around the corner, Yui must prepare.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Prigione oscura dei fiori sparsi","synopsis":"6 months have passed, and one fine day Thoth suddenly declares that mid-term exams are in 3 days, shocking Yui. They attempt to study together using Tsukito's perfect notes, but a Yui has been experiencing strange dreams of Apollon's past, while Apollon has been losing sleep as well. From the dreams, Yui finds out about a woman named Cassandra that Apollon loved so much to the point where he gave her a part of his divine power to see the future, until she committed suicide much to his anguish. Hades, knowing that Cassandra's spirit never entered the underworld, worries that she holds a grudge against Apollon and is wandering in the human world to haunt him. However, this proves to be the opposite as Cassandra possesses Yui's body to convey her true feelings to Apollon, freeing him from his long-term grief and breaking his shackle, allowing him to graduate. Everyone forgets about their exams until Tsukito reminds them, to which they have done no studying.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10305","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20542","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21563","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60828","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278332","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"38193","synopsis":"Yui and her friends put on a version of cinderalla, which turns out nothing like the original thanks to two mischevious gods...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/278332/4902907.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Yui and her friends put on a version of cinderalla, which turns out nothing like the original thanks to two mischevious gods...","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Bello ed effimero","synopsis":"Despite not studying, the gods and Yui have faired pretty well on their exams, so Zeus gives them to \"honour\" of putting on a play for the rest of the students, who are spirits summoned by him. Per Yui's suggestion, they decide to enact the fairytale of Cinderella, with everyone competing for the main male part of the Prince until they draw lots. The play goes smoothly until Loki tries to stage a coup d'etat and Anubis Ma'at, the Egyptian God of the Dead, steals some of Dionysus' homemade juice and crashes into the stage. Despite the havoc wrecked, all the students appear to have enjoyed the play.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10305","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20542","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21563","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60828","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278332","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"38189","synopsis":"While Apollon and Yui make sure that Balder is okay after he passes out, they hear through the grapevine that the gods have nothing good planned for Balder.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/278332/4902908.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"While Apollon and Yui make sure that Balder is okay after he passes out, they hear through the grapevine that the gods have nothing good planned for Balder.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Catene del fato","synopsis":"Balder collapses suddenly after the play. As Apollon and Yui visit him in the infirmary, they overhear Loki telling Thor about he will kill Balder, much to their shock. Loki explains that whenever there is light, there will also be darkness, which rests as an inborn power within Balder as the God of Destruction. When Balder awakens, he realises Loki's aims and accepts his death as a dangerous being. However, Loki is unable to do so, prompting Balder to jump off a cliff instead and commit suicide.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10305","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20542","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21563","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60828","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278332","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"38190","synopsis":"Into the dark abyss of the sea goes Balder. Deeper and deeper he plunges into the nothingness all for the benefit of the world. With Loki right behind him, will the light shine through?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/278332/4914513.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"Into the dark abyss of the sea goes Balder. Deeper and deeper he plunges into the nothingness all for the benefit of the world. With Loki right behind him, will the light shine through?","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Separazione eterna","synopsis":"Balder awakens as the God of Destruction and the universe starts to collapse with the immensity of power. The remaining gods have their shackles broken through human acts of emotion in the midst of chaos and transform to rescue their friend. Zeus dissolves the spirit students as he attempts to use his power to keep the universe intact. Yui, wanting to help, uses the sword to absorb the knowledge and feelings contained within the chandelier's container, which is now full, and gives it to Loki. While Balder is saved, the universe is beginning to collapse despite Zeus channeling energy into it. The 8 gods make a decision to use their remaining power in returning Yui to her universe, each one thanking her for teaching them and Apollon confessing his love for her. Yui returns to her time at the exact same moment she left, and can now only look on the memories her new friends have given her.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:20542","mal:21563"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10305","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12